{"unit_id":"tag:0214:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在上述定义中，我们<TEXTBFOPEN_0001>不<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001>假设态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>是标准平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的。原因在于，如果这样假设，标准平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）覆盖（coverings）就不能在<MATH_0002>上定义景（site），例如由于《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>的 (4)。另一方面，平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）态射（morphism），其对象为仿射概形（affines），自动是标准光滑（smooth）的，见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>。因此，标准平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）覆盖（covering）是标准光滑（smooth）覆盖（covering）和标准辛托米克（syntomic）覆盖（covering）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0004>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"辛托米克"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"定义中的态射，未批准"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"标准平展性质，未批准"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"标准覆盖性质，未批准"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"景的覆盖，未批准"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"所定义的景，未批准"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章名，未批准"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"仿射间态射性质，未批准"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"仿射间态射，未批准"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"态射对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"sm