{"unit_id":"tag:021A:statement","translation":"<TEXTITOPEN_0001>大平展景（big <ACCENT_0001>tale site）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是任意景（site）<MATH_0001>，如《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>中所述，按如下方式构造：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 选择任意概形（schemes）集合（set）<MATH_0002>，以及这些概形（schemes）之间的任意平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）覆盖（coverings）集合（set）<MATH_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 作为底层范畴（underlying category），取任意范畴（category）<MATH_0004>，它如《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>中那样从集合（set）<MATH_0005>出发构造。\n<STRUCT_0004> 选择任意覆盖（coverings）集合（set），如《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0003>中所述，从范畴（category）<MATH_0006>、平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）覆盖（coverings）的类（class）以及上面选定的集合（set）<MATH_0007>出发。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"big <ACCENT_0001>tale site","target_term":"大平展景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"big <ACCENT_0001>tale site","target_term":"大平展景","context":"定义术语，未批准"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"所构造景，未批准"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"引用章名，未批准"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"选定对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"构造集合，未批准"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"选定覆盖性质，未批准"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"构造的覆盖，未批准"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"景的范畴，未批准"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"构造的范畴，未批准"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合","context":"引用章名，未批准"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖类限定，未批准"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"覆盖的类，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
